{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo contains the first few levels from the full version of Phero, including the tutorial and 8 different species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/spawn.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spawn your seeds and insects into the environment. Watch your plants and populations grow on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/unlock.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new species and introduce them into an increasingly complex micro ecosystem with symbiosis, predators and prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/observe.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe how simple interactions lead to emergent behavior such as trails of ants, swarms of flies, shapes of plants and dynamics of populations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/prepare.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare an ecosystem with enough diversity to defend against infestations that might threaten your plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/improve.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your spawn order, timing and location to recover from infestations faster as a bonus challenge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739880?t=1749114909","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/ec4bbf5ffdf24a7b2cee1948588ec2c735b55c3f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749114909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/2da0bfdce9e2bbafb9277876b571f7025ea1bfb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749114909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/2da0bfdce9e2bbafb9277876b571f7025ea1bfb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749114909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This free demo contains the first few levels from the full version of Phero, including the tutorial and 8 different species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/spawn.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spawn your seeds and insects into the environment. Watch your plants and populations grow on their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/unlock.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new species and introduce them into an increasingly complex micro ecosystem with symbiosis, predators and prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/observe.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Observe how simple interactions lead to emergent behavior such as trails of ants, swarms of flies, shapes of plants and dynamics of populations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/prepare.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare an ecosystem with enough diversity to defend against infestations that might threaten your plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/extras/improve.png?t=1749114909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improve your spawn order, timing and location to recover from infestations faster as a bonus challenge.</p>","developers":["Flattermouse"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3679320","name":"Phero"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739880/33762d4074a2f4fef748c04735549d6c93ba07f2/header.jpg?t=1749114909","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or better</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Big Sur 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or better</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257140447,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140447/movie480.mp4?t=1748560032","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140447/movie_max.mp4?t=1748560032"},"name":"Phero","thumbnail":"https://shared.akama